OL,4,CSurgeon leaves hospital amid review    
OL,5,Cinto patient harm                      
OL,6,GA specialist surgeon has left a world- 
OL,7,Grenowned NHS hospital investigating    
OL,8,Ghow hundreds of children in its care   
OL,9,Gwere harmed.                           
OL,11,FKuldeep Stohr had been suspended by    
OL,12,FCambridge's Addenbrooke's Hospital     
OL,13,Fsince 2025, over concerns about        
OL,14,Fsurgeries that fell "below the         
OL,15,Fexpected standard".                    
OL,17,FAn interim report, published           
OL,18,Fmistakenly in September, revealed 209  
OL,19,Fpatients - mostly children -           
OL,20,F"experienced harm" following surgery   
OL,21,Fperformed by Stohr between 2012 and    
OL,22,F2024.                             G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
