OL,4,CDriver arrested after woman fatally    
OL,5,Chit by car                             
OL,6,GA man has been arrested on suspicion   
OL,7,Gof causing death by dangerous driving  
OL,8,Gafter a pedestrian was fatally struck  
OL,9,Gby a car.                              
OL,11,FThe collision happened shortly before  
OL,12,F14:50 GMT in Wherstead Road, Ipswich,  
OL,13,Fand involved a grey Nissan.            
OL,15,FAn air ambulance attended but Suffolk  
OL,16,FPolice said the pedestrian, a woman in 
OL,17,Fher 50s, died at the scene.            
OL,19,FThe Nissan driver, 26, was arrested    
OL,20,Fand taken to Martlesham Police         
OL,21,FInvestigation Centre for questioning,  
OL,22,Fwhere he remained on Wednesday eveG2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
