OL,4,CHusband who plotted wife's murder      
OL,5,Closes appeal bid                       
OL,6,GA man jailed for hiring a hitman to    
OL,7,Gmurder his wife has lost a bid to      
OL,8,Gappeal against his conviction.         
OL,10,FCarol Morgan, 36, was found dead at    
OL,11,Fthe couple's shop in Leighton Buzzard, 
OL,12,FBedfordshire on 13 August 1981.        
OL,14,FHer then husband, Allen Morgan, was    
OL,15,Fconvicted of conspiracy to murder in   
OL,16,FJuly 2024 and jailed for life with a   
OL,17,Fminimum term of nearly 22 years. The   
OL,18,Fkiller has never been identified.      
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
