OL,4,CTwo men charged with trying to steal   
OL,5,Ccufflinks and clock from royal home    
OL,6,GTwo men charged with trespassing at    
OL,7,Gthe Prince and Princess of Wales's     
OL,8,Gcountry home are accused of trying to  
OL,9,Gsteal cufflinks and a clock.           
OL,11,FPolice were called to Anmer Hall, on   
OL,12,Fthe Sandringham estate in Norfolk,     
OL,13,Fshortly before 18:00 GMT on Monday     
OL,14,Fafter reports of suspicious activity.  
OL,16,FMirgen Doku, 34, and Arilen Ndoci, 32, 
OL,17,Fboth of no fixed address, have been    
OL,18,Fcharged with entering a dwelling with  
OL,19,Fintent to steal and trespassing on a   
OL,20,Fprotected site.                        
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
